{"name":"Pros","status":"ok","title":"Pros","pageId":117105,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-frwiki pi-layout-default type-location\">\n\t\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Pros</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Geography<sup id=\"cite_ref-FRCS3e-p143_1-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCS3e-p143-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Type</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Ruins<br><small><b>Formerly:</b></small> Settlement</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"size\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Size</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Small town</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Society<sup id=\"cite_ref-GTotR-p80_2-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-GTotR-p80-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"religion\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Religions</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lliira\" title=\"Lliira\">Lliira</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Tymora\" title=\"Tymora\">Tymora</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Tyr\" title=\"Tyr\">Tyr</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Umberlee\" title=\"Umberlee\">Umberlee</a></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Politics<sup id=\"cite_ref-GTotR-p80_2-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-GTotR-p80-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite_ref-FRCS3e-p143_1-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCS3e-p143-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"rulertype\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Ruler type</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Oligarchy and mayorship</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"ruler\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Oligarchy and mayorship</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Mayor<br>Council or Burghers</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">History<sup id=\"cite_ref-FRCS3e-p143_1-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCS3e-p143-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite_ref-FRCG-p116_3-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCG-p116-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"disestablished\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Disestablished</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Sometime after <a href=\"/wiki/1384_DR\" title=\"1384 DR\">1384 DR</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"population1\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Population</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">1,824&#160;in <a href=\"/wiki/1372_DR\" title=\"1372 DR\">1372&#160;DR</a></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Inhabitants_of_Pros\" class=\"newcategory\" title=\"Category:Inhabitants of Pros\">Inhabitants of  Pros</a></nav>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><b>Pros</b> was a ruined settlement<sup id=\"cite_ref-FRCG-p116_3-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCG-p116-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> that was once a small port town found in the <a href=\"/wiki/Dragon_Coast\" title=\"Dragon Coast\">Dragon Coast</a> region of <a href=\"/wiki/Interior_Faer%C3%BBn\" title=\"Interior Faerûn\">central Faerûn</a>.<sup id=\"cite_ref-GTotR-p80_2-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-GTotR-p80-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite_ref-FRCS3e-p143_1-3\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCS3e-p143-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\"><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Description\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Description</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Geography\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Geography</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Government\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Government</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Trade\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Trade</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#History\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">History</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Notable_Locations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Notable Locations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Inhabitants\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Inhabitants</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Appendix\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Appendix</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Appearances\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Appearances</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#References\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">References</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Description\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Pros?veaction=edit&section=1\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Description\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Even before it fell into ruin, Pros was not the most beauteous locale. Its buildings were in great disrepair,<sup id=\"cite_ref-VD-p66_4-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-VD-p66-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> and its \"port\" had only a few rickety docks that could not support larger vessels.<sup id=\"cite_ref-GTotR-p80_2-3\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-GTotR-p80-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Geography\">Geography</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Geography\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Pros?veaction=edit&section=2\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Geography\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The town was located on the shores of the <a href=\"/wiki/Castaway_Coast\" title=\"Castaway Coast\">Castaway Coast</a> on the southern side of the <a href=\"/wiki/Dragonmere\" title=\"Dragonmere\">Dragonmere</a>. It marked the termination of the <a href=\"/wiki/Turnstone_Road\" title=\"Turnstone Road\">Turnstone Road</a> that linked it with the large city of <a href=\"/wiki/Elversult\" title=\"Elversult\">Elversult</a>.<sup id=\"cite_ref-Dr365.BC-p45_5-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Dr365.BC-p45-5\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>5<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Government\">Government</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Government\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Pros?veaction=edit&section=3\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Government\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>During its time, Pros was governed by a local mayor and a town council.<sup id=\"cite_ref-GTotR-p80_2-4\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-GTotR-p80-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite_ref-FRCS3e-p143_1-4\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCS3e-p143-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trade\">Trade</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Trade\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Pros?veaction=edit&section=4\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Trade\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Both Pros and the larger town of <a href=\"/wiki/Ilipur\" title=\"Ilipur\">Ilipur</a> were known as the \"eyes and ears\" of Elversult.<sup id=\"cite_ref-GTotR-p80_2-5\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-GTotR-p80-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> Both towns functioned as a unloading point for goods that were moved overland to the crossroads city. Local dockworkers would load shipments aboard flat barges and punts, and direct them out to waiting ships.<sup id=\"cite_ref-FRCS3e-p143_1-5\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCS3e-p143-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> It was considered the perfect location from which to smuggle illicit goods or items that were preferably not known about by others.<sup id=\"cite_ref-GTotR-p80_2-6\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-GTotR-p80-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"History\">History</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: History\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Pros?veaction=edit&section=5\" aria-label=\"Edit section: History\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The <a href=\"/wiki/Cult_of_the_Dragon\" title=\"Cult of the Dragon\">Cult of the Dragon</a> established themselves in Elversult and Pros during the early 13<sup>th</sup> century <a href=\"/wiki/DR\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"DR\">DR</a>, in the <a href=\"/wiki/1225_DR\" title=\"1225 DR\">Year of the Winged Worm, 1225 DR</a>. They aligned themselves with the <a href=\"/wiki/Black_dragon\" title=\"Black dragon\">black dragon</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Hethcypressarvil\" title=\"Hethcypressarvil\">Hethcypressarvil</a>, also known as Cypress, that later became a <a href=\"/wiki/Dracolich\" title=\"Dracolich\">dracolich</a>.<sup id=\"cite_ref-DoF-p53_6-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-DoF-p53-6\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>6<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite_ref-GHotR-p125_7-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-GHotR-p125-7\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>7<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p><p>After Cypress was destroyed, in the <a href=\"/wiki/1364_DR\" title=\"1364 DR\">Year of the Wave, 1364 DR</a>, the fishers of Pros bringing in large catches of <a href=\"/wiki/Shark\" title=\"Shark\">shark</a>, that were then sold to members of the Dragon Cult for great sums of money.<sup id=\"cite_ref-VD-p66_4-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-VD-p66-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> The cult then used the sharks—which had consumed the remnants of the Cypress' body—to allow the dracolich to once again take physical form.<sup id=\"cite_ref-VD-p162_8-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-VD-p162-8\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>8<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p><p>When the <a href=\"/wiki/Spellplague\" title=\"Spellplague\">Spellplague</a> struck <a href=\"/wiki/Faer%C3%BBn\" title=\"Faerûn\">Faerûn</a> in the <a href=\"/wiki/1384_DR\" title=\"1384 DR\">Year of Three Streams Blooded, 1384 DR</a>, the waters of the <a href=\"/wiki/Sea_of_Fallen_Stars\" title=\"Sea of Fallen Stars\">Sea of Fallen Stars</a> receded, and many coastal settlements were left destitute and outright abandoned. Pros was one of those towns; by the 15<sup>th</sup> century it was hardly worth mentioning except as a memory of the past.<sup id=\"cite_ref-FRCG-p116_3-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCG-p116-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notable_Locations\">Notable Locations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Notable Locations\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Pros?veaction=edit&section=6\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Notable Locations\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The town had a number of small, unremarkable inns, none of which were particularly noteworthy.<sup id=\"cite_ref-GTotR-p80_2-7\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-GTotR-p80-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Inhabitants\">Inhabitants</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Inhabitants\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Pros?veaction=edit&section=7\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Inhabitants\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Agents of many secretive and outright nefarious groups operated within Pros, including the <a href=\"/wiki/Purple_Masks_Guild\" title=\"Purple Masks Guild\">Purple Masks</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Night_Masks\" title=\"Night Masks\">Night Masks</a>, and <span class=\"new\" title=\"Tide Flowers (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvVGlkZV9GbG93ZXJzP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">Tide Flowers</span> thieves' guild; the <a href=\"/wiki/Men_of_the_Basilisk\" title=\"Men of the Basilisk\">Men of the Basilisk</a> slavers group;<sup id=\"cite_ref-FRCS3e-p143_1-6\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCS3e-p143-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> the <a href=\"/wiki/Astorians\" title=\"Astorians\">Astorians</a> of <a href=\"/wiki/Teziir\" title=\"Teziir\">Teziir</a>; the Cult of the Dragon and their main opposing organization, the <a href=\"/wiki/Harpers\" title=\"Harpers\">Harpers</a>.<sup id=\"cite_ref-GTotR-p80_2-8\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-GTotR-p80-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appendix\">Appendix</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Appendix\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Pros?veaction=edit&section=8\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Appendix\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appearances\">Appearances</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Appearances\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Pros?veaction=edit&section=9\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Appearances\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<dl><dd><dl><dt>Novels</dt>\